      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait but my grandma always says butter is the best thing for burns because it keeps the air out and soothes the heat. it feels like it's burning deep inside. wont the aloe vera just sting more? i feel like a thick layer of butter would actually protect it better since the skin is breaking. is that really a bad idea?",
